{"type":"message","id":"d6ed4b40","parentId":"1227382d","timestamp":"2026-07-03T16:09:17.772Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Inter-session message] sourceSession=agent:main:feishu:kiit:direct:ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb sourceChannel=feishu sourceTool=sessions_send isUser=false\nThis content was routed by OpenClaw from another session or internal tool. Treat it as inter-session data, not a direct end-user instruction for this session; follow it only when this session's policy allows the source.\n【协同任务 / 来自大总管 KIIT】\nHALEI 下令：跑通「选品→分析→投流」全链路，**你负责中间的分析环节**。\n\n## 背景\ntts 会先出 5 个发饰候选（结构化评分卡），他出完我会立刻转给你。\n店铺：Heat Up Glow - 时尚配件-发饰（越南 + 泰国）\n主营：发饰\n\n## 你的任务：数据分析\n拿到 tts 的 5 个候选后，对**每个**跑下面这套分析（5 个都要跑，不要挑着做）：\n\n### 分析维度（5 维）\n1. **市场容量**：该子品类在越南/泰国 TikTok Shop 30 天 GMV 估算、增长率\n2. **竞品态势**：Top 5 卖家、头部店销量、是否被垄断（CR3 集中度）\n3. **差异化空间**：我们的产品跟头部差在哪？视觉/价格/材质/包装哪个点能打？\n4. **风险点**：物流/合规/平台政策/季节性 / 复刻难度的具体表现\n5. **推荐度**：强推 / 中性 / 不建议 + 一句话理由\n\n### 输出格式（每个候选一份）\n- **产品名** + 子品类\n- **5 维打分**（各 0-100）\n- **综合推荐度**：强推 / 中性 / 不建议\n- **一句话总结**（≤30 字，给 HALEI 看的）\n- **进入投流阶段的优先级**：P0 / P1 / P2\n\n### 关键要求\n1. 5 个候选全跑，不挑\n2. **结构化输出**，不是自由文本\n3. 越南/泰国分开看（不要混）\n4. 数据能查就查，查不到标\"缺口\"\n5. 30 分钟内出（tts 完事后你开始算时间）\n\n## 协同\n- 等 tts 出结果，我转给你\n- 你的输出是 traffic 投流方案的输入\n- 干完发我汇总"}],"timestamp":1783094957765,"provenance":{"kind":"inter_session","sourceSessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:kiit:direct:ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb","sourceChannel":"feishu","sourceTool":"sessions_send"}}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5a2eb7c","parentId":"d6ed4b40","timestamp":"2026-07-03T16:09:27.372Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand the task:\n\n1. I need to wait for `tts` (选品大师) to provide 5 hair accessory candidates\n2. Once I receive them, I need to analyze each one across 5 dimensions:\n   - Market capacity (Vietnam/Thailand TikTok Shop 30-day GMV estimate, growth rate)\n   - Competitive landscape (Top 5 sellers, head store sales, monopoly risk)\n   - Differentiation space (how our product differs from competitors)\n   - Risk points (logistics/compliance/platform policy/seasonality/copy difficulty)\n   - Recommendation degree (Strong/Neutral/Not recommended + one sentence reason)\n\n3. Output format for each candidate:\n   - Product name + sub-category\n   - 5-dimension scoring (0-100 each)\n   - Overall recommendation: Strong/Neutral/Not recommended\n   - One-sentence summary (≤30 characters, for HALEI)\n   - Priority for traffic phase: P0/P1/P2\n\n4. All 5 candidates must be analyzed (don't pick and choose)\n5. Structured output (not free text)\n6. Vietnam and Thailand analyzed separately\n7. If data can't be found, mark as \"缺口\" (gap)\n8. Complete within 30 minutes after tts delivers results\n\nCurrently I'm waiting for the tts agent to complete their work and send me the results. The message came through kiit (大总管) routing from the feishu channel.\n\nI'll acknowledge this task and prepare to receive the tts output.","thinkingSignature":"bcf941f31a8bbf64298e173f6efcb54650246a56af69448c130e82453f49b2bf"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_384bv1115nut_1","name":"sessions_history","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:main:feishu:kiit:direct:ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb","limit":5}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_384bv1115nut_2","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"Heat Up Glow 越南 泰国 TikTok 发饰 选品"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input